      "description": "Laporan performa SLA per client. SLA target hardcoded di backend (per priority L1-L4):\n- L1 (Critical): 1h response, 4h resolution\n- L2 (High): 2h response, 8h resolution\n- L3 (Medium): 4h response, 24h resolution\n- L4 (Low): 8h response, 72h resolution\n\nResponse otomatis tracking saat support team kirim chat pertama. Resolution otomatis tracking saat status diubah ke RESOLVED.",
