    {
      "name": "Chat API (WebSocket + REST)",
      "description": "Chat real-time antara ADMIN dan USER menggunakan WebSocket STOMP.\n\n## WebSocket Connection\n- **Endpoint**: ws://localhost:8080/ws (SockJS)\n- **Auth**: Kirim header STOMP `Authorization: Bearer <token>` saat CONNECT\n- **Subscribe**: /topic/chat/{ticketId}\n- **Send**: /app/chat.send\n\n## WebSocket Message Format (Send - Text Only)\n```json\n{\n  \"ticketId\": 1,\n  \"content\": \"Halo, saya butuh bantuan\"\n}\n```\n\n## WebSocket Message Format (Send - With Attachments)\n```json\n{\n  \"ticketId\": 1,\n  \"content\": \"Ini screenshot errornya\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [1, 2]\n}\n```\n\n## WebSocket Message Format (Receive)\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"ticketId\": 1,\n  \"ticketNumber\": \"TKT-20260525-001\",\n  \"senderId\": 2,\n  \"senderName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"senderRole\": \"USER\",\n  \"content\": \"Ini screenshot errornya\",\n  \"sentAt\": \"2026-05-25T10:30:00\",\n  \"attachments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"fileName\": \"screenshot.png\",\n      \"fileType\": \"image/png\",\n      \"fileSize\": 234567,\n      \"downloadUrl\": \"/api/v1/chat/attachments/1/download\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Alur Kirim File\n1. Upload file via `POST /api/v1/chat/upload` → dapat `attachmentId`\n2. Kirim pesan WebSocket ke `/app/chat.send` dengan `attachmentIds: [id]`\n3. Server broadcast pesan + info attachment ke semua subscriber\n\nNote: Postman tidak mendukung STOMP over WebSocket secara langsung. Gunakan REST endpoints untuk upload file dan mengambil histori chat.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload Chat File",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {"key": "ticketId", "value": "1", "type": "text"},
                {"key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "Pilih file yang akan dikirim di chat (gambar, PDF, dokumen, dll). Max 10MB."}
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chat/upload",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "chat", "upload"]
            },
            "description": "Upload file untuk dikirim di chat. Response berisi attachmentId yang harus di-include di pesan WebSocket saat mengirim.\n\nAlur:\n1. Upload file via endpoint ini → dapat attachmentId\n2. Kirim pesan WebSocket dengan attachmentIds: [attachmentId]"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Download Chat Attachment",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chat/attachments/1/download",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "chat", "attachments", "1", "download"]
            },
            "description": "Download file lampiran chat berdasarkan attachment ID. Access control: user harus memiliki akses ke ticket terkait."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Chat History by Ticket ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chat/1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "chat", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil semua pesan chat untuk ticket tertentu berdasarkan ticket ID. Pesan diurutkan berdasarkan waktu kirim (ascending). Response termasuk info attachment di setiap pesan."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Chat History by Ticket Number",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chat/ticket/TKT-20260525-001",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "chat", "ticket", "TKT-20260525-001"]
            },
            "description": "Mengambil semua pesan chat untuk ticket tertentu berdasarkan ticket number. Pesan diurutkan berdasarkan waktu kirim (ascending). Response termasuk info attachment di setiap pesan."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
